{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\n37 test modules (about 7,000 LOC; 464 nodes today) pin one-time module splits as permanent invariants: re-export identity, \"leaf\" import shape, LOC floors and headroom, \"shim no longer reachable\". They fail on legitimate refactors and assert nothing about behaviour; 43 behaviour-test nodes are trapped inside them. The per-file verdict table with node counts is this ticket's first comment; the file list and every move are stated below. Cites are on origin/main 083620b0; counts are re-measured below.\n\n## Approach\nDELETE-WHOLE (git rm, nothing moves), 14 files: `tests/scripts/test_cli_seam_clean_heldout.py`, `tests/scripts/test_mcp_server_seam_clean_heldout.py`, `tests/scripts/test_store_snapshot_io_seam_clean_heldout.py`, `tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_happy.py`, `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/apply/test_inbound_apply_seam_split.py`, `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_inbound_differ_module_seam.py`, `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/diffing/test_outbound_comments_split_import.py`, `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_fetch_paging_split.py`, `tests/unit/test_decide_ops_seam.py`, `tests/unit/test_gate_dispatch_seam.py`, `tests/unit/test_init_ensures_seam.py`, `tests/unit/test_prompt_model_module_seam.py`, `tests/unit/test_signing_module_split.py`, `tests/unit/test_structured_run_seam.py`. The coverage each deletion relies on is checked by the survivor AC below.\n\nDELETE-BUT-MOVE (move the named tests with their helpers, then git rm the source), 11 files: `tests/scripts/test_binding_lifecycle_grace_seam_clean_heldout.py` (2 tests to `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/state/test_binding_absence_lifecycle.py`); `tests/scripts/test_llm_seam_clean_heldout.py` (2 tests to `tests/interfaces/store/test_gate_source_threading.py`, which already imports `gate_source`); `tests/scripts/test_reconciler_core_seam_clean_heldout.py` (4 bug-c0b9 `reconciler_repo_root` tests + `_noneditable_package_config_file` and `test_repo_root_precedence_is_preserved`, `test_reconciler_event_identity_env_override_propagates` to new `tests/unit/test_reconciler_repo_root_c0b9.py`; `last_pass` tests to `tests/interfaces/facades/test_reconciler_last_pass_heldout.py`; invariants test to `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_invariants.py`; the tautological `test_owned_in_place_toggle_is_read_live` is dropped); `tests/scripts/test_reconciler_jira_seam_clean_heldout.py` (settings tests to `state/test_config_jira_wiring.py`, cutover tests + `_rebar_unimportable` to `test_rich_text_cutover.py`, pandoc test to `test_wiki_render_hardening.py`, all under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/`); `tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_seam_clean_heldout.py` (`test_log_level_resolution_is_preserved` to new `tests/unit/test_logging_level.py`; opcert test to `tests/unit/test_opcert_local_verify_binding.py`; mirror-guard test to `tests/unit/test_mirror_guard.py`; review-bot port test to `tests/unit/review_bot/test_rp04_s5_startup.py`; grounding tests to `tests/unit/grounding/test_harness.py` and `test_resolve.py`; the `REBAR_SIGNING_KEY` env test is dropped, the HMAC epic deletes that env var); `tests/unit/plan_review/test_det_floor_module_seam.py` (`test_det_checks_still_runs_all_eleven_checks_in_order` to `tests/unit/test_det_floor_clarity.py`); `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/apply/test_comment_dedup_seam_crossing.py` (2 tests to `apply/test_comment_id_acli_envelope.py`); `tests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py` (git mv to `tests/unit/test_agent_call.py`, dropping `test_agent_call_clears_the_split_floor`, `test_agent_call_has_no_runtime_import_from_runner`, `test_runner_no_longer_builds_the_kwargs_dict_inline`, the `_loc`/`_SRC`/`_RUNNER`/`_AGENT_CALL`/`_SPLIT_FLOOR` constants and the `ast`/`pathlib` imports); `tests/unit/test_cli_registry_split.py` (3 tests to `tests/unit/test_cli_registry.py`, reusing its `_codes` at `:135`); `tests/unit/test_config_resolver_seam.py` (3 tests + `_project` to `tests/interfaces/store/test_gate_source_threading.py` after `:177`, adding `from rebar import _config_resolvers, _config_sources` there because the moved bodies patch and call those modules at `:139-170`); `tests/unit/test_gate_context_seam.py` (1 test to `tests/interfaces/store/test_agent_op_safeguard.py` after `:61`). Moved tests keep their docstrings; the imports their bodies need are added at each destination.\n\n`tests/unit/test_processors_status_split.py`: move `test_status_fold_replay_equivalence` + `_apply_status` to `tests/unit/test_plan_review_phase_reducer.py`, rewriting the helper body from `processors_status.process_status(...)` to the bare `process_status(...)` that module imports at `:10`.\n\nKEEP unchanged the 11 behaviour modules named in the first comment (plus the rich-text module below); in `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_rich_text_seam_heldout.py` delete `test_cloud_send_path_prose_names_shared_codec_owner` (`:35-42`) and rename the file to `test_rich_text_seam.py` (unpaired held-out module). Destination paths under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/` are stated at the current name; the reconciler epic's rename carries them.\n\nNode arithmetic, RE-MEASURED on origin/main 62d775a5b11 (supersedes the 083620b0 counts; e.g. `test_signing_module_split.py` fell 57 -> 33 nodes with the HMAC retirement): the 37 `seam|split` files + `test_residual_drain_happy.py` collect **464** nodes. Kept **147** (11 unchanged files = 126; `test_rich_text_seam.py` 9; `test_agent_call.py` 12), moved **43**, deleted **274**; 147 + 43 + 274 = 464. 12 `seam|split` files remain (the 11 unchanged + `test_rich_text_seam.py`); the earlier \"13\" counted one file twice.\n\nThe moves the list above leaves implicit are named test-by-test in this ticket's comment \"Re-measured on origin/main 62d775a5b11\".\n\n## Scope\nIn scope: the 25 deleted files, the two new files, the renamed file, and the destinations named above. Out of scope: every file under `src/` and `scripts/`, the `Makefile`, `pyproject.toml`, and every test module not named above (the CI-parity, check-script and import-scan modules belong to S2, S3 and S4 of this epic).\n\n## Testing\nTwo `pytest --collect-only -q` runs over the files the ACs name, before and after, recorded on this ticket with the per-file counts. Each destination module is also run in full (`pytest <dest> -q`). Then `make verify`, the pre-push gate (lint + typecheck + CI's test selection).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] The 25 deleted `seam|split` modules and `test_residual_drain_happy.py` are gone: `git ls-tree -r --name-only HEAD -- tests | grep -E 'seam|split'` lists exactly the 12 kept files.\n- [x] Every moved test collects at its destination by node id (`pytest --collect-only -q <dest>::<name>` for each of the 43 moved nodes) and passes there (`pytest <dest> -q`).\n- [x] Coverage the deleted guards relied on still runs and passes: `pytest -q` on `fetch/test_fetcher_pagination_jql.py::test_fetcher_paginates_through_1500_issues_in_100_step_increments`, `fetch/test_fetcher_truncation_gate.py::test_fetch_at_1200_issue_ceiling_raises_silent_truncation_error` (both under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/`), `tests/unit/workflow/test_plan_review_assemble_memo.py::test_memoized_assemble_returns_identical_context` and `::test_cache_does_not_leak_across_scopes`, `tests/interfaces/store/test_ensures.py::test_registry_id_set_is_frozen`, `tests/unit/test_attestation_signing.py::test_gate_code_version_falls_back_to_baked_sha`, `tests/interfaces/store/test_llm_optionality.py::test_interface_import_pulls_no_agents_stack[rebar.llm]`.\n- [x] 147 kept + 43 moved = 190 surviving nodes against 274 deleted (= 464), reconciled from the two `pytest --collect-only -q` runs recorded on this ticket.\n- [x] `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` exits 0 with no unadmitted `new` entry.\n- [x] `make verify` exits 0 apart from the 17 arm64-host pandoc failures tracked in frenzied-snively-llama."}},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1792406662744680001,"uuid":"b7509ba9-d64a-4675-8df1-63966b362ff4"}